 ('Trout (brook, brown, rainbow, splake)', array['rainbow trout','brown trout','brook trout','steelhead'], array['MN'], null, null, 'total', false, '5 per day (streams: only 1 over 16″; lakes: no more than 3 over 16″)', false, null, null,
  'Streams in the southeast: open Jan 1 – Oct 15 but catch and release only Jan 1 – second Saturday in April and Sep 15 – Oct 15. Other streams: second Saturday in April – Sep 30. Lakes: two weeks before Memorial Day weekend – Oct 31, and winter seasons on some. Some waters have special rules.',
  'https://www.revisor.mn.gov/rules/6262.0200/', '2026-10-21', true),
